          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "Affordable High-Quality Seeds:"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " Farmers will receive Kufri Chipsona-I potato seeds at an estimated price of ₹4,000/- per quintal or the actual seed price, whichever is lower."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "Financial Assistance: "
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Total ₹93,863/- per hectare (First year: ₹70,397/- and Second year: ₹23,466/-)."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "ul_list"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n  - **Affordable High-Quality Seeds:** Farmers will receive Kufri Chipsona-I potato seeds at an estimated price of ₹4,000/- per quintal or the actual seed price, whichever is lower.  - **Financial Assistance:** Total ₹93,863/- per hectare (First year: ₹70,397/- and Second year: ₹23,466/-).\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to increase the production of Kufri Chipsona variety suitable for potato processing in Bihar by expanding its area and to increase the income of farmers by promoting processing.\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "“Aaloo Ke Kufri Chipsona-1 Prabed Ke Kshetra Vistaar Yojana” launched by the Department of Agriculture, Bihar, aims to increase the production of Kufri Chipsona variety suitable for potato processing in Bihar by expanding its area and to increase the income of farmers by promoting processing. Under this scheme, certified quality seeds of Kufri Chipsona variety suitable for potato processing will be made available to farmers."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": ""
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "“Aaloo Ke Kufri Chipsona-1 Prabed Ke Kshetra Vistaar Yojana” launched by the Department of Agriculture, Bihar, aims to increase the production of Kufri Chipsona variety suitable for potato processing in Bihar by expanding its area and to increase the income of farmers by promoting processing. Under this scheme, certified quality seeds of Kufri Chipsona variety suitable for potato processing will be made available to farmers.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
